sequenceDiagram
  actor User
  participant UI as Import / Review UI
  participant Ingest as Video Importer
  participant Shot as Shot Detector
  participant Frames as Keyframe Extractor
  participant VLM as VLM Adapter
  participant Pose as Optional MediaPipe
  participant Builder as Storyboard Builder
  participant Validator as Schema Validator
  participant Store as JSON + Image Assets

  User->>UI: Select video
  UI->>Ingest: Open video
  Ingest->>Ingest: Read metadata (FPS, duration, resolution)
  Ingest->>Shot: Analyze frames / detect boundaries
  Shot-->>Frames: Shot boundaries
  Frames->>Frames: Select representative keyframes
  Frames-->>VLM: Keyframes + timestamps
  opt Motion cues enabled
    Frames-->>Pose: Frames / sampled video
    Pose-->>Builder: Pose landmarks and motion cues
  end
  VLM->>VLM: Describe frames and infer shot-level narrative
  VLM-->>Builder: Descriptions, actions, entities, continuity
  Builder->>Validator: Build storyboard document
  Validator->>Validator: Check schema, timestamps, asset references
  alt Valid storyboard
    Validator->>Store: Save storyboard.json and keyframes
    Store-->>UI: Storyboard artifact
    UI-->>User: Display editable storyboard panels
    User->>UI: Edit captions / reorder panels
    UI->>Store: Save reviewed JSON
  else Validation errors
    Validator-->>UI: Errors with panel references
    UI-->>User: Show validation feedback
  end
